"""Copy this file to ``secrets.py`` (gitignored) or load the key yourself.

``secrets.py`` typically reads ``GEMINI_API_KEY`` from the process environment
or, on WSL, from the Windows User environment via powershell.

Windows: Settings → System → About → Advanced system settings → Environment
Variables → User variable ``GEMINI_API_KEY``.

Shell override::

    export GEMINI_API_KEY="your-key"
"""
